	(text "Giris suzgeci: 4k7 + 10n (ortak) + 1u (fark). Termokupl klemensi entegrenin HEMEN yaninda olmali (soguk uc sicakligi ayni olsun)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330 40 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0086404f-8955-524f-a7b0-191327db5fff")
	)
	(text "5 atesleme gerilimi, 6 ada gerilimi / 2, 7 bos (GND_ISO). SPI saati en cok 2 MHz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 221 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0702b706-3cb9-5dd6-a790-3972453a1f30")
	)
	(text "220R on yuk modulun en az yuk sartini (%10) saglar. Olcumler 4,096 V referansa gore yapildigi icin ada gerilimindeki degisim sonucu etkilemez."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "13c3644c-bd7e-52a9-b941-2485fb29b636")
	)
	(text "Eksi uc 1M ile GND_ISO'ya bagli (uretici onerisi): govdeye degen termokuplla da calisir, kopuk termokuplda cikis tavana gider."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330 34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "31c2b1c3-172e-58c6-adaa-274d53fcf499")
	)
	(text "0,1 A'lik kendini onaran sigortadan gecer: dis kablodaki kisa devre adayi cokertmez."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330 266 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3ea66aa6-1018-58a1-b3db-40ddd3b821ea")
	)
	(text "YALITIMLI BESLEME (NXE1S0505MC: 5 V -> 5 V, 1 W, 3 kV): ada gerilimi yuke gore 4,5-5,5 V arasinda degisir (duzenlemesiz modul)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5264cdab-2ab7-5bfb-84f0-99f4516ac0bb")
	)
	(text "A: saat, B: veri (islemci -> ADC), C: secme, D: bos; E: veri (ADC -> islemci), F: yakit akis darbesi."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 126 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "65efd37a-93f9-5a00-91a0-da4ffde02b68")
	)
	(text "SPI YALITICI (ISO7762: 4 ileri + 2 geri kanal; iki tarafi ayri beslenir: islemci tarafi 3,3 V, ada tarafi 5 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 120 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8f397ee3-8981-5459-8d26-cf6893115208")
	)
	(text "ADC (MCP3208, 12 bit, 8 kanal) ve REFERANS (LM4040 4,096 V): 1 basamak = 1 mV. Kanallar: 0-1 termokupl, 2-3 NTC, 4 yakit seviyesi,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 215 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9e99bbf4-871c-554c-a0f3-0a3b7a310f56")
	)
	(text "TERMOKUPL GIRISLERI (K tipi; AD8495: soguk uc duzeltmeli, 5 mV/C): 1 = silindir kafasi, 2 = egzoz. Olcum ust siniri 4,096 V = yaklasik 800 C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b063c93f-dfa1-5118-8d8f-a0f8750e20b9")
	)
	(text "YAKIT: seviye (0-5 V analog; 10k/39k ile 0-3,98 V) ve akis olcer darbesi (acik kollektor; 10k yukari cekme). Sensor beslemesi +5V_SENS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330 260 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b4385ddb-e472-583d-8223-253d1e54e004")
	)
	(text "NTC GIRISLERI (2 adet, 10 k): 10 k %0,1 ile referansa bolucu (olcum referansa oranli). Ornek: yag/sogutma, karbrator havasi."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330 170 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f7d74286-6e75-5ae2-b745-5c001cfac1aa")
	)
